README for HRS2303 raw underway
2023-07-12 Stace Beaulieu
This is the 1-min temporal resolution underway product generated using two data sources: 
- ship-provided underway data files as processed on board,
- PAR: column "qsr_s_n_10367" from ship-provided PAR file.
I did not find documentation for PAR units, but magnitude is consistent with units umol photons/m2/sec as on previous Endeavor cruises (uE/m2/sec on previous Armstrong cruises).
